msgid "Select 'Yes' to enable add debug output to log."
msgstr "Jurnalga disk raskadrovka chiqishini qo‘shishni yoqish uchun “Ha” ni tanlang."

msgid "Select 'Yes' to enable the addition of Weather."
msgstr "Ob-havo qo'shilishini yoqish uchun \\\\\\\"Ha\\\\\\\" ni tanlang."

msgid "Select location"
msgstr "Joyni tanlang"

msgid "Select the City and Press Ok"
msgstr "Shaharni tanlang va OK tugmasini bosing"

msgid "Select the detail level in the detail view. You have the choice between a comprehensive presentation in a smaller font and a reduced presentation with a larger font."
msgstr "Tafsilotlar ko'rinishida tafsilotlar darajasini tanlang. Sizda kichikroq shriftdagi keng qamrovli taqdimot va kattaroq shriftli qisqartirilgan taqdimot o'rtasida tanlov mavjud."

msgid "Select the metric unit for wind speed to be used for wind displays. This has no effect on the imperial unit 'mph'."
msgstr "Shamol ko'rsatkichlari uchun shamol tezligi uchun metrik birlikni tanlang. Bu imperatorning \\\\\\\"mph\\\\\\\" birligiga ta'sir qilmaydi."

msgid "Select the preferred weather service to supply the weather information."
msgstr "Ob-havo ma'lumotlarini taqdim etish uchun afzal qilingan ob-havo xizmatini tanlang."

msgid "Select the temperature unit to be used for temperature displays."
msgstr "Harorat ko'rsatkichlari uchun ishlatiladigan harorat birligini tanlang."

msgid "Select this option to save that last obtained weather data locally. This is used to initialize the data immediately after restart while updated data is being fetched."
msgstr "Oxirgi olingan ob-havo maʼlumotlarini mahalliy darajada saqlash uchun ushbu parametrni tanlang. Bu yangilangan ma'lumotlar olinayotganda qayta ishga tushirilgandan so'ng darhol ma'lumotlarni ishga tushirish uchun ishlatiladi."

