msgid "Specify how often Weather retrieves its data from the server. 'Once' means the data will loaded only once after a GUI or system start."
msgstr "Ob-havo maʼlumotlarini serverdan qanchalik tez-tez olishini belgilang. \\\\\\\"Bir marta\\\\\\\" ma'lumotlar GUI yoki tizim ishga tushirilgandan keyin faqat bir marta yuklanishini anglatadi."

